    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a bit vague. When you say Sub-Saharan Africa might need \"more intensive, hands-on management,\" are you implying there's a cultural difference in how they approach following instructions or punctuality compared to, say, Eastern Europe? I need to be able to justify the extra management costs to my stakeholders.",
